            <p class="article-subheadline">
            <p class="article-byline">
            <div class="article-content">
                <span style="color:#be0d34;"><span style="font-size:16px;"></span></span>

<div class="sidearm-story-image-align-center" style="text-align:center"><img alt="a" data-airgap-id="54" height="444" src="/common/controls/image_handler.aspx?thumb_id=14&image_path=/images/2022/5/2/RDP00099.JPG" style="display: inline-block;" width="667"></div>
<span style="color:#be0d34;"><span style="font-size:16px;"><br>
<strong>Ripon College Red Hawks Baseball Camp - Winter 2026</strong></span></span>

<div>
<div>We are proud to announce the dates of our annual baseball camps!  Our coaching staff will focus on mechanics and fundamentals, and our Ripon College players will be present, along with our coaching staff to direct the camps.</div>
</div>
<br>
<strong>Players in grades 5-12</strong><em> </em><strong>may register.</strong><br>
<br>
<span style="color:#be0d34;"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;">Details</span></strong></span><span style="color:#555559;"></span>

<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="2"><strong>HITTING CAMP</strong></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><span style="color:#555559;"><strong>Date:</strong></span></td>
			<td>Sundays: January 18th, 25th, February 1st</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><span style="color:#555559;"><strong>Time:</strong></span></td>
			<td>9 a.m. - noon <em>(8:30 a.m. check-in begins)</em></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><strong>Location:</strong></td>
			<td>Willmore Center<br>
			508 Union Street<br>
			Ripon, WI 54971</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>

<table border="0" cellpadding="1" cellspacing="1" style="width:500px;">
	<tbody>
		<tr>
			<td colspan="2"><b>PITCHER/CATCHER CAMP</b></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><span style="color:#555559;"><strong>Date:</strong></span></td>
			<td>Sundays: January 18th, 25th, February 1st</td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><span style="color:#555559;"><strong>Time:</strong></span></td>
			<td>1 - 4 p.m. <em>(12:45 p.m. check-in begins)</em></td>
		</tr>
		<tr>
			<td><strong>Location:</strong></td>
			<td>Willmore Center<br>
			508 Union Street<br>
			Ripon, WI 54971</td>
		</tr>
	</tbody>
</table>
<span style="color:#be0d34;"><strong><span style="font-size:16px;"><br>
Costs</span></strong></span><br>
$60 per person, per session<br>
<em>(hitting or pitching/catching - any day)</em><br>
*$150 any 3 sessions<br>
*$190 any 4 sessions<br>
*$220 any 5 sessions<br>
*$250 per person to attend all 6 sessions 
<pre class="prettyprint">
<a href="/documents/2025/11/5/RIPON_BASEBALL_CAMPS_2026.pdf" style="display: block; height: 50px; width: 200px; background: #be0d34; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 100%; line-height: 50px; font-family: Arial; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none;">2025 CAMP BROCHURE</a><a href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSdF-ktugC9lBsb7oU1QI7s5IziQMljdOFdq-WAjrzTriATb4Q/viewform" style="display: block; height: 50px; width: 200px; background: #be0d34; color: #ffffff; text-align: center; font-weight: bold; font-size: 100%; line-height: 50px; font-family: Arial; border-radius: 20px; text-decoration: none;">ONLINE REGISTRATION</a></pre>
<span style="color:#FFFFFF;"></span>
